# Localization

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) Localization Key Convention.

- No hardcoded user-facing strings in backend or frontend
- `Error.Code` is the localization key
- Format: `BoundedContext.Entity.State` or `Layer.Rule`
- FluentValidation messages via `ITranslator`, not literals
